  "meta": {
    "version": "0.2",
    "date": "2026-09-06",
    "source": "P4 brand tokens reconciled with P2/P3, per Design Direction v1 §2",
    "note": "Stage B: fillMine/onMine added (theme-safe \"mine\" fill for booked squares and available circles; never use brand pine as a foreground on themed surfaces); week chip 44/slot 52 per DD §2. | v0.2 (Stage C): the semantic colours now have a per-theme pair in colour.light.semantic and colour.dark.semantic, matching the dark values tokens.css already carried by hand. Before this, only one light-mode set existed here, so every component that needed a danger or warning colour hard-coded both themes inline — the same class of defect as Stage B defect 1. colour.semantic is kept as the light reference."
  },
